Subject: [flux] Register FluxAgentServiceFactory before profiles are built

Flux opened a window for the first time and then died the moment the console
loaded:

  FATAL:components/keyed_service/core/dependency_manager.cc:76] DCHECK failed:
  Trying to register KeyedService Factory: `FluxAgentService` after the call to
  the main registration function
  ChromeBrowserMainExtraPartsProfiles::EnsureBrowserContextKeyedServiceFactoriesBuilt()

  flux::FluxAgentServiceFactory::GetForProfile
  flux::FluxPageHandler::FluxPageHandler
  flux::FluxUI::CreatePageHandler

Every BrowserContextKeyedServiceFactory has to exist before any profile does,
so that the dependency graph is complete when one is created. The factory is a
base::NoDestructor singleton constructed on first use, and its first use was
the console asking for the agent service - long after profiles were built.

Nothing about the fork made this happen; it is the ordinary registration step
every keyed service in Chromium performs, and the fork simply never did it. It
could not surface until the browser got far enough to open chrome://flux,
which is why it waited behind the syncable-prefs crash.

Registered in the common alphabetical block, between FirstRunServiceFactory
and FontPrefChangeNotifierFactory.

--- a/chrome/browser/profiles/chrome_browser_main_extra_parts_profiles.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/profiles/chrome_browser_main_extra_parts_profiles.cc
@@ -101,6 +101,7 @@
 #include "chrome/browser/file_system_access/file_system_access_permission_context_factory.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/finds/finds_service_factory.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/first_party_sets/first_party_sets_policy_service_factory.h"
+#include "chrome/browser/flux/flux_agent_service_factory.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/font_pref_change_notifier_factory.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/glic/public/glic_enabling.h"
 #include "chrome/browser/glic/public/glic_keyed_service_factory.h"
@@ -1086,6 +1087,7 @@
     ash::floating_sso::FloatingSsoServiceFactory::GetInstance();
   }
 #endif
+  flux::FluxAgentServiceFactory::GetInstance();
   FontPrefChangeNotifierFactory::GetInstance();
   FromGWSNavigationAndKeepAliveRequestTrackerFactory::GetInstance();
 #if !BUILDFLAG(IS_CHROMEOS)
